[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0010","text":"……那个，摩美美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0020","text":"嗯——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0030","text":"你现在有什么困扰的事，或者烦恼吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0040","text":"嗯——\n……倒是没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0050","text":"多小的事都行\n比如说——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0060","text":"……不，抱歉\n没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0070","text":"这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0080","text":"……不好意思啊\n工作前问这些奇怪的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0090","text":"……我倒无所谓啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0100","text":"待会儿的现场，我打完招呼就得去别的地方\n留你一个人不好意思，但拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0110","text":"……知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0112","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0120","text":"田中先生，很好！\n接下来试试站姿吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0130","text":"是——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0140","text":"（接下来也是单人工作来着——）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0150","text":"（我倒是无所谓这种事）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0152","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0160","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0170","text":"站姿这样就可以了！\n接下来请坐姿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0180","text":"好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0190","text":"（咲耶说过的那种事……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02050000_02_0200","text":"（那种事也……\n　会有的吗……）"}]
